        /// </returns>
        /// <remarks>
        ///   <para>
        ///     If <c>line</c> is less than 0, this will return a zero length substring at the
        ///     beginning of the text with the TTF_SUBSTRING_TEXT_START flag set. If <c>line</c>
        ///     is greater than or equal to <c>text-&gt;num_lines</c> this will return a zero
        ///     length substring at the end of the text with the TTF_SUBSTRING_TEXT_END
        ///     flag set.
        ///   </para>
